>
>Apparently there is a connection between being confused and certain
>types of enchantment.  What is it?


  All scrolls act differently when read while confused.  They
also tend to have different effects depending on their blessed/
uncursed/cursed status.  Confused reading can interact with the
b/u/c status.

  The confused effect can be more or less useful than the 
unconfused effect.  Or it can be just as useful, but in a 
different situation than normal.

